  "description": "Hulk Hogan is a legendary professional wrestler and one of the most iconic figures in WWE history. His persona, characterized by his black bandana, yellow sunglasses, and catchphrases like 'Hulkamania,' is globally recognized. His dramatic entrance and speeches at major events like WrestleMania are part of his signature style. Understanding the meme requires knowing that he is a cultural icon whose exaggerated persona is used for humor and celebration.",
